<title>USA: WMX Technologies sets $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>WMX Technologies sets $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from WMX Techologies Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER WMX TECHNOLOGIES INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	COUPON 6.00 PCT	  MATURITY 11/02/1998</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	  ISS PRICE 99.868	 FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A1     YIELD 6.071 PCT	  PAY FREQ  N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS   SPREAD 28 BP/WI 2 YR   CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678</p>
